  "text": {
    "markdown": "## RSVP: team offsite in Porto, 12–13 September\n\nFirst question: **are you coming?**\n\n- **No** — just reply \"No\" and that is all I need. An optional line on why helps the organisers, but you can skip it.\n- **Yes** — great. Then I need three more things:\n\n1. **Dietary needs.** None, vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, halal, kosher, or something else. Please also mention any allergies.\n2. **Hotel room.** Do you need one? If yes, for which nights:\n   - 11 September (the night before, if you are arriving early)\n   - 12 September\n   - 13 September (if you are leaving the day after)\n3. **T-shirt size.** XS, S, M, L, XL or XXL.\n\nYou can answer in one line, for example:\n\n> Yes. Vegetarian, no allergies. Hotel on the 12th only. T-shirt M.\n\nor fill this in:\n\n```\nComing: yes / no\nDietary needs:\nAllergies:\nHotel room: yes / no\nNights: 11 Sep / 12 Sep / 13 Sep\nT-shirt size: XS / S / M / L / XL / XXL\n```\n\nIf you are not sure yet, tell me and I will record you as \"maybe\" and ask again closer to the date.\n",
    "validation": {
